tests/golden/check/fixedbugs-2432-an-address-ending-in-a-keyword-is-offered-no-entry.hero:13:5: error[use_holds_an_address]: `github.com/acme/match` is an address, which the catalogue `heroes.toml` beside the file you compile holds and a `use` never does: the `use` names its entry between `<` `>`, then a module of the package — `use <json>/parse`, `json` standing for the entry the catalogue gives that address and `parse` for one of the package's modules
